OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy in the west but generally a
OL,7,Ffine and dry evening. Cloud builds
OL,8,Fthrough the night from the northwest
OL,9,Fwith patchy light rain developing.
OL,10,FMild with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FOvercast with rain turning
OL,13,Fpersistent with blustery heavy,
OL,14,Fpotentially thundery with hail,
OL,15,Foutbreaks possible. Rain turns lighter
OL,16,Fand patchy during the afternoon with
OL,17,Fcloud breaking and a cold night
OL,18,Ffollowing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
